  {
    "episode_id": 51126,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51126.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Well, one, let me give great kudos to my Senate counterpart, Mike Crapow. I don't think we would have had any bill but for his leadership, but for his efforts. And I consider him to be a good friend in a good ally. But all House members are frustrated with the Senate. Never underestimate the Senate's capacity to do nothing. The Senate is not a majoritarian institution. I would think these two observations would be fairly obvious to even a casual observer of the United States Congress. So I had hopes that we could end up going to conference I found out that that wasn't going to happen. That was frustrating, not just for me. I mean, again, I lead a band of men and women of great privilege to lead them, and they had many different bills, that many of which were not particularly controversial. that were left on the Senate cutting room floor. That should have been in any negotiation or any conference. We were displeased with the way the Senate handled this, but at the end of the day, they did come up with something. As you know, in order to, it was never a question of whether or not we would have a deregulation, a deregulatory banking bill. The only thing that was in question was what was its precise timing in this Congress and how robust would it be? So after some negotiations and meetings with my membership, we did decide that we would let 2155 proceed. And we are, you know, imitation is the greatest form of flattery, probably by any discernible measure, two thirds to three quarters of the pro-growth measures in that bill started in the house. So we take great pride in that, but we also had a lot of other good work product that deserves to go through the entire legislative process, and that's when we entered into an agreement that we would have a trailing capital formation bill in the Senate has committed to take that out, the timing of which remains uncertain. So hopefully that answers the question.",
