    "turn_text": "But even some of the moderate Democrats in the Senate have said that they would like to see more sort of consumer protection provisions added to it, maybe something related to dealing with Equifax or the credit bureaus. Are there any more sort of consumer protection things like that that you'd be willing to concede?",
