  {
    "episode_id": 51126,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51126.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "You recently said in an interview at the American Enterprise Institute, and I'm going to quote you here, between trying to get rid of the farm program, trying to get rid of vaccine, trying to get rid of the GSEs, I've taken on a lot of very, very tough causes. And unfortunately, after having battled for 16 years, I haven't found a whole lot of allies. What would you say to maybe some critics in both parties who might argue that it may have been more productive to sort of push more compromised bills through the house?",
