      {
        "text": "Public confusion between capitalism and crony capitalism undermines democratic trust in markets.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Moral credibility in reforming government programs depends on clean hands regarding corporate subsidies.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Future generational fiscal responsibility requires structural changes to entitlement systems.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "America’s success in free enterprise is uniquely robust compared to other nations.",
